OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of flights cancelled at
OL,4,AUK airports as air traffic control
OL,5,Aissue causes widespread disruption
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of flights are cancelled at
OL,8,Fairports across the UK due to an issue
OL,9,Fwith air traffic control
OL,11,FNats - the air traffic control provider
OL,12,F- says the glitch is with its "flight
OL,13,Fprocessing system" and that a fix has
OL,14,Fbeen deployed, later adding recovery
OL,15,Fwas "taking longer than hoped"
OL,17,FHeathrow, Manchester and East Midlands
OL,18,Fairports are among those reporting
OL,19,Fissues - airports in Scotland and
OL,20,FIreland are also experiencing delays
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
